Description: Git status emblems for Nautilus
 This package installs a Nautilus Python extension that overlays Git status
 emblems on files and directories inside Git repositories.
 .
 It can show modified, added, deleted, untracked, clean, repository,
 and ahead-of-remote states directly in the Nautilus file manager.

